flowchart LR
    U[User / Console Menu] --> S[MessageOrderingSimulator]
    S --> P1[SimProcess P1]
    S --> P2[SimProcess P2]
    S --> P3[SimProcess P3]
    S --> Q[Pending Message List]
    S --> L[Event Log]
    P1 -->|send event| Q
    P2 -->|send event| Q
    P3 -->|send event| Q
    Q -->|manual delivery + FIFO check| S
    S -->|receive event / Lamport update| P1
    S -->|receive event / Lamport update| P2
    S -->|receive event / Lamport update| P3
    S --> L
